=== the within-patient contrast ===
acute vs subacute is the one contrast free of the composition confounder (see analyses/x2_confounder.R).
  replicates available:        4
  measured CV in those groups: 0.317
  depth used:                  133 counts
  DEGs actually found:         2
  power at a twofold effect:   0.846
  replicates for 80% power:    4

