power at a twofold effect, median gene, by multiple-testing assumption:
                                              assumption        alpha power_n4
 no correction: alpha = 0.05 per test (as in the course) 5.000000e-02    0.846
                         Bonferroni: alpha = 0.05 / 1292 3.869969e-05    0.128
 n_for_80pct
           4
